Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:49:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] app-server: test the channel barrier

The fake channel server supports channel/fence: while fenced it refuses
new input, and a fence request emits its backlog, then the marker. The
tests hold input accepted before the fence, release it or deliver it on
reopening, keep user turns working while closed, and check the error
reasons.
